-- Regulation 22A.
`reclaim that ceased work on 1 May 2024` MEANS `Reclaim after loss of employment` WITH
    `the new award is made in a case to which regulation 21(3C) applies` IS TRUE
    `the claimant, or either joint claimant, is not in paid work` IS TRUE
    `day on which the claimant ceased paid work` IS YMD 2024 5 1
    `last day of the previous award` IS YMD 2024 4 1
    `date on which the claim is made` IS YMD 2024 6 1
    `the Secretary of State considers there is good reason for the delay in making the claim` IS FALSE
    `number of days in the period as the Secretary of State extends it` IS 7
`reclaim that ceased work on 25 May 2024` MEANS `Reclaim after loss of employment` WITH
    `the new award is made in a case to which regulation 21(3C) applies` IS TRUE
    `the claimant, or either joint claimant, is not in paid work` IS TRUE
    `day on which the claimant ceased paid work` IS YMD 2024 5 25
    `last day of the previous award` IS YMD 2024 4 1
    `date on which the claim is made` IS YMD 2024 6 1
    `the Secretary of State considers there is good reason for the delay in making the claim` IS FALSE
    `number of days in the period as the Secretary of State extends it` IS 7
`reclaim that ceased work on 26 May 2024` MEANS `Reclaim after loss of employment` WITH
    `the new award is made in a case to which regulation 21(3C) applies` IS TRUE
    `the claimant, or either joint claimant, is not in paid work` IS TRUE
    `day on which the claimant ceased paid work` IS YMD 2024 5 26
    `last day of the previous award` IS YMD 2024 4 1
    `date on which the claim is made` IS YMD 2024 6 1
    `the Secretary of State considers there is good reason for the delay in making the claim` IS FALSE
    `number of days in the period as the Secretary of State extends it` IS 7
`reclaim that ceased work on the day the previous award ended` MEANS `Reclaim after loss of employment` WITH
    `the new award is made in a case to which regulation 21(3C) applies` IS TRUE
    `the claimant, or either joint claimant, is not in paid work` IS TRUE
    `day on which the claimant ceased paid work` IS YMD 2024 4 1
    `last day of the previous award` IS YMD 2024 4 1
    `date on which the claim is made` IS YMD 2024 6 1
    `the Secretary of State considers there is good reason for the delay in making the claim` IS FALSE
    `number of days in the period as the Secretary of State extends it` IS 7
`reclaim that ceased work the day after the previous award ended` MEANS `Reclaim after loss of employment` WITH
    `the new award is made in a case to which regulation 21(3C) applies` IS TRUE
    `the claimant, or either joint claimant, is not in paid work` IS TRUE
    `day on which the claimant ceased paid work` IS YMD 2024 4 2
    `last day of the previous award` IS YMD 2024 4 1
    `date on which the claim is made` IS YMD 2024 6 1
    `the Secretary of State considers there is good reason for the delay in making the claim` IS FALSE
    `number of days in the period as the Secretary of State extends it` IS 7
